theme_override_font_sizes/mono_font_size = 17
text = "AI center campuses require a lot of land. While the main buildings range in size from 7-40 hectares, which corresponds to 10-55 football fields, the entire campus can span between 30 and 350 hectares, which corresponds to 30-500 football fields. They not only take up a lot of space, but also transform the land they occupy. Often, peri-urban and agricultural landscapes are used for these specialised industrial zones, which can result in the loss of productive farmland."

